
UTA TEAM 2 AI ADVISOR
CSE 4392/5320 - Team Project Assignment 2: An Academic AI Advisor Using LangChain
Team 2: Marvin Wellington, Joseph Fitchett, Ryan Patterson, Sarthak Wadhawan, Emily Ford
 
 
SUBMISSION CONTENTS
-------------------
 
presentation/
    PowerPoint for the final presentation: architecture, code segments and
    demo screenshots.
 
logs/
    langchain-logs.txt   		Execution traces from the LangChain backend (docker logs).
                 			Shows each chat request, the route chosen for each question,
                 			and the chat-history summaries.
    rag-pipeline-logs.csv      	AWS Lambda logs from the RAG ingestion pipeline. Shows each
                 		    	document processed, chunks stored and embeddings created.
 
source-code/
    chat-ui/     Streamlit web interface: student sign-in (Amazon Cognito) and
                 the chat page that sends questions to the backend.
 
    langchain/   FastAPI + LangChain backend:
                   main.py           /chat endpoint, ties all steps together
                   router.py         LLM router that picks one of 6 routes
                   memory.py         LLM summary of older chat history
                   rag.py            Vector search (Titan + ChromaDB) and answers
                   advisor.py,
                   advisor_tools.py  Student records, prerequisite checks and
                                     degree plans from DynamoDB
                   course_context.py Finds the course a follow-up refers to
 
    rag/
        documents/      All documents used to generate the embedding vectors
                        (UTA catalogs 2022-2027, degree requirements,
                        prerequisites, policies).
        lambda-func.py  AWS Lambda function that parses, chunks (LangChain
                        text splitter), embeds (Titan Embeddings V2) and stores
                        the documents in ChromaDB.
 
 
MODELS AND SERVICES
-------------------
LLM:         Google Gemma 3 27B IT on Amazon Bedrock
Embeddings:  Amazon Titan Text Embeddings V2 on Amazon Bedrock
Databases:   ChromaDB (vectors), DynamoDB (student and course records)
Hosting:     Docker containers on AWS EC2, deployed with GitHub Actions
 